sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Developer
    participant G as GitHub
    participant C as CI pipeline
    participant A as ArgoCD
    participant K as Cluster

    D->>G: Open pull request
    G->>C: Run pipeline
    C-->>G: Tests, image scan, secret scan, manifest checks
    Note over G: Merge is blocked until ci-ok passes
    D->>G: Merge to main
    A->>G: Detect new commit
    A->>K: Apply configuration and database
    A->>K: Run migration job
    A->>K: Rolling update of backend and frontend
    K-->>A: Healthy and Synced
    Note over C,K: The pipeline never holds cluster credentials
